      "heading": "B — Audience and scope",
      "learner_facing": false,
      "markdown": "## B — Audience and scope\n\nAudience: first-time Iowa license applicants learning belt and child-seat law, blind-spot habits, and phone law, in plain English.\n\nPrerequisites: none beyond basic car vocabulary; this section teaches occupant protection and attention discipline.\n\nScope note: blind spots, restraints, cargo, and distraction only. Impairment and trip planning live in later sections.\n\nLaw emphasis: age bands and banned interactions are practiced as rule recall, so this section feeds the dedicated restraint-and-phone surface declared in part C.\n",
